      "summary": "Bincode is unmaintained",
      "details": "Due to a doxxing and harassment incident, the bincode team has taken the decision to cease development permanently.\n\nThe team considers version 1.3.3 a complete version of bincode that is not in need of any updates.\n\n## Alternatives to consider\n\n* [wincode](https://crates.io/crates/wincode)\n* [postcard](https://crates.io/crates/postcard)\n* [bitcode](https://crates.io/crates/bitcode)\n* [rkyv](https://crates.io/crates/rkyv)",
